            "tab_label": "Nip Coverage",
            "tab_content": "<p>Sometimes, the pads in our bras, sports bras, swimsuits or dresses aren't enough. Honey Cloudz inserts help prevent nip-show without adhesives on skin or annoying outlines. Looking for nip-coverage without any bulk? The Oval Lites Bra Inserts or the Oval Classic Bra Inserts are your best choice.</p>"
