          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_label": "Balancing",
            "tab_content": "<p>If you're looking to balance uneven sizes or gently restore shape after volume loss or lumpectomy, there's a Cloud for you. Here's a quick guide to find your perfect fit:</p><ul><li><strong>Lites:</strong> The lightest of all. Ideal for light asymmetry.</li><li><strong>Classics:</strong> Light, everyday shaping. Creates a natural look + balances up to ½ cup.</li><li><strong>Plus+:</strong> Double the thickness from Classics. Provides fuller, more defined shaping, and balances up to 1 cup.</li><li><strong>Push-ups:</strong> Designed ultra-plush and firm to help provide a natural lift and boost any sagging.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_label": "Lifting",
            "tab_content": "<p>Our Push-up pads provide an instant lift that creates both fullness and roundness. The gradual padding provides a boost (about one cup size). They're also lightweight (1-2 oz.), cloud-soft against skin, and don't create the annoying visible outline.</p>"
